{"3790450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Secret Of Greenwood Isle", "steam_appid": 3790450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and sounds required during the production process were created with the help of AI tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final result was carefully reviewed and re-edited before use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take this into consideration before purchasing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The repeated curse of Amalian. <br>Will I be able to survive in the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Former photojournalist Ryan carries a certain trauma from the city </i><br> <br> <br><i>and arrives at the remote southern island of “Greenwood Island.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just as he begins to adapt to the peaceful everyday life, </i><br> <br> <br><i>cracks begin to appear in the once calm Greenwood Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dust-covered lens of his camera begins to shine toward the island’s truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/51e358cbb8717be0bb9a64946489f49c.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/93fee7096893378234d38dfa25d05b04.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1240 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/353fd52b5b6df563d59cd0cccde363d4.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/91950ca9254a7f62c43f920ee184eb9a.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/d429c4c770db19e7b0530c5958257630.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the climax of the prayer during the “Holy Night” ritual, rain falls without exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the island is hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the enchanting scenery lies a layered, dark truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/560da387e3c50518f0a968d18151cdba.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1240 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/6a34a2fdf5c7da824339d5f6279df476.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1240 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/2af1d6e7e61b5d4c5e301a9a4c67d41f.avif?t=1769748546\" width=1240 height=694 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deduction Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth will not be revealed all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross through routes and puzzles to uncover the faith of Amalian and the secrets of Greenwood Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph